anese Fluffy Sponge Cake","tags":["dessert","japanese","cake","fluffy","technique"],"ingredients":["6 eggs (whites and yolks separated), at room temperature","60g sugar (for the yolks)","80g sugar (for the whites)","60g unsalted butter","100ml whole milk","90g flour (T45 or cake flour)","20g cornstarch","1/4 tsp salt","A few drops of lemon juice or white vinegar","1 tsp vanilla extract (optional)"]}]